# Allowlist: everything is ignored by default; only the lines below are published.
# Adding a new public page/file requires adding it here too — that's intentional,
# it's what makes this an allowlist instead of a denylist that re-leaks silently.
*
!*/
# Do NOT add `!/_headers` here. Wrangler reads `_headers` straight off disk as
# configuration (independently of this file), and separately hard-codes
# `/_headers` as an always-ignored upload pattern. Un-ignoring it does not help
# Cloudflare find it — it only publishes the config file itself at /_headers.
!/index.html
# index-1.html, index-2.html and index3.html are deliberately NOT published.
# They are unlinked draft variants carrying dollar claims with no derivation
# (an "average Savvy user finds $847/year" on index-1, "$1,565" on the other
# two). Nothing in savvy_landing or savvy-frontend links to them, they are
# absent from sitemap.xml, and they already carry noindex - but noindex is not
# unpublished, and a direct URL still served them. Re-add a line here only
# once every figure on that page is traceable to a committed derivation.
!/privacy.html
!/terms.html
!/sms-consent.html
!/connect-ai.html
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/Assets/
!/Assets/**
!/js/
!/js/**
!/cards/
!/cards/**
